    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A thrilling, fast-paced climbing game where players unlock different boons and choose diverse paths to ascend each climb. Control a character in the form of a ball and unlock permanent upgrades to enhance your gameplay. Navigate past various traps as you face the constant risk of falling back to the start.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Climbing Mechanics:</strong> Master momentum-based movement to scale handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression:</strong> Unlock <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> (e.g., double jumps, speed boosts, or wall jumps) to tackle increasingly difficult climbs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward:</strong> Choose between multiple paths\u2014some safe but slow, others laden with traps but offering unique power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Hazards:</strong> Dodge spinning traps, collapsing platforms, laser turrets, and environmental hazards that punish careless moves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> One wrong move could send you tumbling\u2026 but the thrill of the climb will keep you coming back!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A thrilling, fast-paced climbing game where players unlock different boons and choose diverse paths to ascend each climb. Control a character in the form of a ball and unlock permanent upgrades to enhance your gameplay. Navigate past various traps as you face the constant risk of falling back to the start.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Climbing Mechanics:</strong> Master momentum-based movement to scale handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression:</strong> Unlock <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> (e.g., double jumps, speed boosts, or wall jumps) to tackle increasingly difficult climbs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward:</strong> Choose between multiple paths\u2014some safe but slow, others laden with traps but offering unique power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Hazards:</strong> Dodge spinning traps, collapsing platforms, laser turrets, and environmental hazards that punish careless moves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> One wrong move could send you tumbling\u2026 but the thrill of the climb will keep you coming back!</p>",
